; Amigram's texts: the catalog description (CatComp/FlexCat form).
; Each text is "MSG_NAME (id//)" and its English form on the next line(s);
; \n is a line break, a line ending in a backslash goes on. The ids never
; change once a release has them: a new text takes a new id. A translation
; is locale/<language>.ct; scripts/catalog.py turns it into
; Catalogs/<language>/amigram.catalog and this file into include/tg_strings.h.
; Keep every %s, %lu, %d of a text in its translation, in the same order.
#language english
#version 1
;
