MSG_RQ_WEBP_OFFER (648//)
Stickers are WEBP pictures, and this system has\n\
no datatype that reads them.\n\
\n\
Amigram can fetch its own webp.datatype (%lu KB)\n\
from %s\n\
and install it:\n\
\n\
    %s\n\
    %s\n\
\n\
No file already there is replaced.
