MSG_T_2FA_PASSWORD_REQUIRED_CHECKING_IT_DERIVE (2095//)
2FA password required.\n\
Checking it derives a key with PBKDF2 (100000 rounds of SHA-512). On a slow 68k, such as a stock 14 MHz 68020, that takes half an hour or more; the dots show it working. Once the key is ready the client asks Telegram for a fresh challenge, so the wait does not lose the login. Enter the password (empty to abort).\n
