MSG_T_68000_LOGIN_WHY (2318//)
--------------------------------------------------------\n\
FIRST LOGIN ON A 68000: PLEASE READ\n\
\n\
Signing in for the first time needs a Diffie-Hellman key\n\
exchange. On a plain 68000 that takes a very long time and\n\
may run out of stack. Do it once elsewhere instead:\n
MSG_T_68000_LOGIN_STEPS (2319//)
 1. Run %s on a faster Amiga (68020 or better)\n\
    or in an emulator (WinUAE, FS-UAE, vAmiga) using the\n\
    standard package, and log in there.\n\
 2. Copy telegram-auth.bin from that drawer into THIS\n\
    drawer, next to %s. Copying\n\
    data/telegram-peers.txt too brings your chat list.\n\
 3. Start this program again: it reuses that login and\n\
    goes straight to the chats.\n
MSG_T_68000_LOGIN_PRESS (2320//)
The login then works on both machines, one at a time:\n\
Telegram closes a login it sees in two places at once.\n\
\n\
Press RETURN to attempt the login here anyway,\n\
or Ctrl+C to quit and follow the steps above.\n\
--------------------------------------------------------\n
